c. transmit any material that is defamatory, offensive or otherwise objectionable in relation to your use of the Tala App or the Service;
d. use the Tala App or the Service in a way that could damage, disable, overburden, impair or compromise our systems or security or interfere with other users; and
e. collect or harvest any information or data from the Service or our systems or attempt to decipher any transmissions to or from the servers running the Service.

